Cell["\<\
If the given expression is part of the term, the expression will be removed \
from the term by subtracting it. Otherwise the term will be returned \
unchanged.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.947257401201996*^9, 3.947257435680441*^9}, {
